Subject: [PATCH] minimum arm64: boot the live medium straight to the desktop

`0043` dropped Installer off the live medium's SYSTEM_APPS/Deskbar
lists, since there is nothing to install to there -- but FirstBootPrompt
itself (Install/Try it out) still came up on every live boot regardless,
since `data/launch/user`'s `run` job enters it whenever the medium is
read-only, which the live medium always is. "Try it out" was the only
button on that screen that actually did anything: clicking "Install"
fails outright now that the binary is gone (FirstBootPromptWindow draws
that button unconditionally, with no check that Installer still exists --
confirmed from `src/apps/firstbootprompt/BootPromptWindow.cpp`, out of
scope to fix there).

The `run` job's own condition is:

    if {
        file_exists /system/bin/FirstBootPrompt
        or { not file_exists .../Locale\ settings ; read_only }
    }
    then { first_boot } else { desktop }

-- so it only ever reaches `first_boot` (and FirstBootPrompt) at all when
the binary exists. Filters FirstBootPrompt out of SYSTEM_BIN the same way
`0043` already filters Installer out of SYSTEM_APPS/DESKBAR_APPLICATIONS,
under the same `RENKU_LIVE_BUILD=1` gate: no `data/launch/user` change
needed, the `run` job's existing `file_exists` check does the rest, and
the live medium now goes straight to the desktop on every boot.

diff --git a/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum b/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
index 71cb51ab..5f81fe79 100644
--- a/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
+++ b/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
@@ -183,6 +183,22 @@ if $(RENKU_LIVE_BUILD) = 1 {
 		}
 	}
 	DESKBAR_APPLICATIONS = $(filteredDeskbarApps) ;
+
+	# data/launch/user's `run` job only ever enters the `first_boot`
+	# target (FirstBootPrompt, with its Install/Try it out buttons) when
+	# /system/bin/FirstBootPrompt exists; otherwise it falls straight
+	# through to `desktop`. Leaving FirstBootPrompt off SYSTEM_BIN here
+	# is enough on its own to skip straight to the desktop on the live
+	# medium -- no data/launch/user change needed, same as Installer
+	# above.
+	local filteredSystemBin ;
+	local bin ;
+	for bin in $(SYSTEM_BIN) {
+		if $(bin) != FirstBootPrompt {
+			filteredSystemBin += $(bin) ;
+		}
+	}
+	SYSTEM_BIN = $(filteredSystemBin) ;
 }

 DESKBAR_DESKTOP_APPLETS =
